From a2eb6131f3741b96609412dc17a221b2c79ccb90 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Adrien Brault <adrien.brault@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 19:13:11 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 02/10] Add an Ampere fallback for sparse indexer scoring

Use BF16 Triton MQA scoring when DeepGEMM cannot execute. Bound
prefill logits by row chunks and use torch top-k to avoid unsupported
persistent kernels. Use fixed launch configs during CUDA capture.

Origin: dsv41reap-pp; new
Upstream: none
